# Quarantined GPR trial artifacts (Legacy/, moved there by refactor F9; renamed
# from Adhoc/ in phase 3). These came from Data/GPR/ and Results/GPR/, which live
# OUTSIDE this repo, so quarantining them into Code/ would otherwise commit ~43 MB
# of dead binary -- including a 42 MB velocity-scan HTML -- into git history
# permanently. The files stay on disk; Legacy/README.md records what they were and
# where they came from, which is the decision history worth keeping (rule 5).
# Deliberately specific rather than a blanket *.npz/*.png: test fixtures such as
# GPR/tests/refs/*.npz MUST be committed or the successor cannot run the tests.
GPR/Legacy/Line5_100MHz_svd1_*
